OL,3,ALabour ends power-sharing with Greens
OL,4,Ain 11 councils over Zionism row
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Labour Party has pulled out of
OL,7,Fpower-sharing agreements with the Green
OL,8,FParty in 11 local councils, after the
OL,9,Fnational party adopted a policy
OL,10,Fdefining Zionism as a form of racism.
OL,12,FLabour councillors will no longer be in
OL,13,Fcoalition with the Greens in areas
OL,14,Fincluding Sheffield, Warwick and Lewes.
OL,16,FLabour Party chair Bridget Phillipson
OL,17,Fsaid: "Labour has been clear from the
OL,18,Fstart that the "Zionism is Racism"
OL,19,Fpolicy crosses a line and we cannot
OL,20,Fwork with any party that supports it `
OL,21,Fat any level of government."
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,0,100
