OL,3,ALabour ends power-sharing with Greens
OL,4,Ain 11 councils over Zionism row
OL,5,
OL,6,FGreen leader Zack Polanski said the
OL,7,Fmove would "backfire" on Labour and
OL,8,Faccused the party of wanting to
OL,9,F"interrupt your local services and
OL,10,Fimpose genocide support from it's local
OL,11,Fcouncils".
